description:
Mission

Akila is looking for an Technical Sales Manager to work with ambition, creativity, and a passion for building our Akila platform to transform and implement sustainability into facility management. The candidate should be comfortable working in a fast-moving startup environment where speed, hard work, and fresh thinking are critical to success

Key Responsibilities

- Identify Opportunities. Identify and optimize opportunities for business growth and development within the relevant business lines to offer the new solution to existing and new clients and promote expansion of the business.

- Provide technical pre-sale support & conduct pre-sales presentations and product demonstration if applicable, in support of Sales’ needs and requests.

- Request for Proposal (RFP) support: Evaluate criteria, coordinate support for entire response process, create deliverable metrics, identify timelines, and coordinate resources. Ensure client needs are met by proposal content; contribute to proposal writing as needed.

- Proposal delivery: QC, edit, and submit proposals as needed by sales, track status and send regular updates to team. Preparation of technical sales materials including collateral, quotation, timeline, project plan and solution proposals.

- Lead Proof of Concept (POC) activities with customers for our platform and set up projects team to ensure success of POC project.

- Proactively provide feedbacks to the Product and R&D and Commercial teams to drive the development and improvement of product direction and features based on customer experience and field observations.

Key Skills

- Solid network within the industry with a minimum of 8 years digital product presales & solution experience.

- Good knowledge on building management/automation system and operation or technical/computer science background.

- Excellent interpersonal skills and easy to connect and relate with. Able to “solution sell” with the ability to listen to your clients and understand what they really need rather than hard sell.

- English language, both oral and written, is a must.

